# Bartolome de las Casas joins: FUN_4345_0342 case 0x18 turns profession 0x1b (Indian Convert) into 0x1c
# (Free Colonist) for owned map units of type 0 only, and for every colonist of owned colonies.
# Start: turns_pioneer_jobs_complete's output (France, Spring 1601, turn 110; England at peace,
# every French map unit fortified, the Europe-bound Caravel held at sea). Fixture (sav_json): France
# liberty_bells_pool = 1000 (threshold 1009 with 5 fathers; the turn's bells cross it) and next_founding_father = 24;
# unit 127 (Colonist, fortified at (43,25)) given profession 27, unit 139 (at Quebec) made a Soldier
# (type 1) with profession 27.
# Covers: Quebec's convert colonist and unit 127 become Free Colonists (28); the Soldier keeps 27 (DOS
# tests unit type 0). Juan de Sepulveda replaces him in the picker; Adam Smith (row 0) is picked.
key space                  # end turn 110 (Spring 1601)
wait 30
key Return                 # Tupi gift of 6 Tobacco to Guadeloupe
wait 6
key Return                 # Bartolome de las Casas has joined the Continental Congress
wait 6
key Return                 # congress screen: close
wait 6
key Return                 # Colonizopedia entry: close
wait 6
key Return                 # next father picker: row 0 Adam Smith
wait 6
key Return                 # price of Cigars falls
wait 6
key Return                 # price of Coats rises
wait 6
